:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
V_{\pi}\left(s\right)=R\left(s\right)+\gamma\sum_{s'}P\left(s'\middle|s,\pi\left(s\right)\right)\cdot V_{\pi}\left(s'\right)
\]

\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula $V_{\pi}$
\end_inset

 הוא ווקטור.
 איך נחשב אותו?
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
V_{\pi}=R+\gamma\overbrace{\left[P\left(s'\middle|s,\pi\left(s\right)\right)\right]_{s,s'\in S}}^{A}\cdot V_{\pi}
\]

\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\left(I-\gamma A\right)\cdot V_{\pi}=R
\]

\end_inset


